update public.content_variants set body = $json${"type":"true_false","answer":true,"question":"ETFs can be traded during exchange hours like regular shares.","difficulty":"beginner","explanation":"Correct! ETFs are traded on stock exchanges and their prices change throughout the trading day, unlike mutual funds whose prices are only calculated once at the end of the day."}$json$::jsonb, body_id = $json${"type":"true_false","answer":true,"question":"ETF bisa diperdagangkan selama jam bursa seperti saham biasa.","difficulty":"beginner","explanation":"Benar! ETF diperdagangkan di bursa saham dan harganya berubah sepanjang hari perdagangan, berbeda dengan reksa dana yang harganya hanya dihitung sekali di akhir hari."}$json$::jsonb where id = 'b07a37ab-d975-4561-bb94-ce2f685f1a04';
update public.content_variants set body = $json${"type":"multiple_choice","answer":"Higher interest","options":["Easier to pull","Higher interest","There are no admin fees","Available for daily transactions"],"question":"What are the main advantages of deposits over savings?","difficulty":"intermediate","explanation":"Deposits offer interest of 3-6% per year, higher than regular savings which is only 0-2%. But in exchange, your money is locked for a certain period."}$json$::jsonb, body_id = $json${"type":"multiple_choice","answer":"Bunga lebih tinggi","options":["Lebih mudah ditarik","Bunga lebih tinggi","Tidak ada biaya admin","Bisa untuk transaksi harian"],"question":"Apa keuntungan utama deposito dibanding tabungan?","difficulty":"intermediate","explanation":"Deposito menawarkan bunga 3-6% per tahun, lebih tinggi dari tabungan biasa yang hanya 0-2%. Tapi sebagai gantinya, uangmu dikunci untuk periode tertentu."}$json$::jsonb where id = 'b157861c-a319-4c66-9362-e56c58b9f278';
update public.content_variants set body = $json${"type":"multiple_choice","answer":"Immediately contact the lender to find a solution","options":["Immediately contact the lender to find a solution","Waiting for debt collectors to come","Stop paying and hope the debt goes away","Borrowing from another pinjol to cover"],"question":"What should you do if you can't pay the installments?","difficulty":"beginner","explanation":"Licensed lenders can often offer restructuring or rescheduling if contacted early."}$json$::jsonb, body_id = $json${"type":"multiple_choice","answer":"Segera hubungi pemberi pinjaman untuk mencari solusi","options":["Segera hubungi pemberi pinjaman untuk mencari solusi","Menunggu debt collector datang","Berhenti membayar dan berharap utang hilang","Meminjam dari pinjol lain untuk menutupi"],"question":"Apa yang sebaiknya dilakukan jika kamu tidak bisa membayar cicilan?","difficulty":"beginner","explanation":"Pemberi pinjaman berizin sering bisa menawarkan restrukturisasi atau penjadwalan ulang jika dihubungi sejak dini."}$json$::jsonb where id = 'b4fbcdb3-9c30-45f6-9858-27407c14097e';
update public.content_variants set body = $json${"type":"multiple_choice","answer":"Crypto commodities/assets","options":["Crypto commodities/assets","The official currency for paying taxes","Company shares","Bank savings guaranteed by LPS"],"question":"In Indonesia, cryptocurrencies are treated as...","difficulty":"beginner","explanation":"Bappebti regulates crypto as a commodity, not as an official currency or capital market product."}$json$::jsonb, body_id = $json${"type":"multiple_choice","answer":"Komoditas / aset kripto","options":["Komoditas / aset kripto","Mata uang resmi untuk membayar pajak","Saham perusahaan","Simpanan bank yang dijamin LPS"],"question":"Di Indonesia, mata uang kripto diperlakukan sebagai...","difficulty":"beginner","explanation":"Bappebti mengatur kripto sebagai komoditas, bukan sebagai mata uang resmi atau produk pasar modal."}$json$::jsonb where id = 'bdc1c8b6-0006-4bc7-8464-bb481bbb749b';
update public.content_variants set body = $json${"type":"multiple_choice","answer":"ETFs provide automatic diversification","options":["ETFs are always more expensive","ETFs provide automatic diversification","ETFs cannot be traded","ETFs are only for wealthy investors"],"question":"What are the main advantages of ETFs over individual stocks?","difficulty":"beginner","explanation":"ETFs track indexes containing many stocks, so a single ETF purchase gives you exposure to dozens or hundreds of companies at once."}$json$::jsonb, body_id = $json${"type":"multiple_choice","answer":"ETF memberikan diversifikasi otomatis","options":["ETF selalu lebih mahal","ETF memberikan diversifikasi otomatis","ETF tidak bisa diperdagangkan","ETF hanya untuk investor kaya"],"question":"Apa keuntungan utama ETF dibanding saham individual?","difficulty":"beginner","explanation":"ETF melacak indeks yang berisi banyak saham, jadi satu pembelian ETF memberi kamu eksposur ke puluhan atau ratusan perusahaan sekaligus."}$json$::jsonb where id = 'c314bbe2-813a-453a-8b8a-7f7db77344df';
update public.content_variants set body = $json${"type":"multiple_choice","answer":"Focus on paying off the debt with the highest interest first","options":["Focus on paying off the debt with the highest interest first","Pay off the smallest debt first","Pay all debts at once","Ignore low-interest debt"],"question":"The avalanche method means...","difficulty":"beginner","explanation":"Avalanche saves the most on interest because the most expensive debt is settled first."}$json$::jsonb, body_id = $json${"type":"multiple_choice","answer":"Fokus melunasi utang dengan bunga tertinggi terlebih dahulu","options":["Fokus melunasi utang dengan bunga tertinggi terlebih dahulu","Melunasi utang terkecil terlebih dahulu","Membayar semua utang sekaligus","Mengabaikan utang berbunga rendah"],"question":"Metode avalanche berarti...","difficulty":"beginner","explanation":"Avalanche menghemat bunga paling banyak karena utang paling mahal diselesaikan lebih dulu."}$json$::jsonb where id = 'c3afbe0a-f0ef-443f-af62-2e4b7a3e93da';
update public.content_variants set body = $json${"type":"fill_blank","answer":"consumer","question":"Bank Indonesia sets credit card interest rate rules to protect _____.","difficulty":"beginner","explanation":"BI regulations aim to prevent card holders from being trapped by interest rates that are too high and not transparent."}$json$::jsonb, body_id = $json${"type":"fill_blank","answer":"konsumen","question":"Bank Indonesia menetapkan aturan suku bunga kartu kredit untuk melindungi _____.","difficulty":"beginner","explanation":"Regulasi BI bertujuan mencegah pemegang kartu terjebak bunga yang terlalu tinggi dan tidak transparan."}$json$::jsonb where id = 'c3b09909-530e-4bbf-9044-ed70dfa22d21';
update public.content_variants set body = $json${"text":"Ani needs two accounts: one for daily expenses and one for emergency funds. He opened BCA Panggangan (savings) for his monthly salary and daily expenses. For emergency funds, he opened a deposit of IDR 5,000,000 with a tenor of 12 months at the same bank. Both are protected by LPS up to IDR 2 billion."}$json$::jsonb, body_id = $json${"text":"Ani butuh dua rekening: satu untuk pengeluaran harian dan satu untuk dana darurat. Dia membuka BCA Tahapan (tabungan) untuk gaji bulanan dan pengeluaran sehari-hari. Untuk dana darurat, dia membuka deposito Rp 5.000.000 dengan tenor 12 bulan di bank yang sama. Keduanya dilindungi LPS hingga Rp 2 miliar."}$json$::jsonb where id = 'c86c170d-7eab-48b9-9075-af733f1304cc';
update public.content_variants set body = $json${"type":"fill_blank","answer":"licensed","question":"OJK reminds you to ensure that your loan or PayLater application is _____ before using it.","difficulty":"beginner","explanation":"Using OJK licensed services is safer because there are binding consumer protection regulations."}$json$::jsonb, body_id = $json${"type":"fill_blank","answer":"berizin","question":"OJK mengingatkan agar memastikan aplikasi pinjaman atau PayLater sudah _____ sebelum digunakan.","difficulty":"beginner","explanation":"Memakai layanan berizin OJK lebih aman karena ada aturan perlindungan konsumen yang mengikat."}$json$::jsonb where id = 'c99fa965-1f93-4247-8e4d-09f484d4f164';
update public.content_variants set body = $json${"text":"Rina spent IDR 500,000 on a crypto prediction application that offered big prizes. He realized this was more like gambling than investing because the outcome was pure luck and the house always had an edge."}$json$::jsonb, body_id = $json${"text":"Rina menghabiskan Rp 500.000 di aplikasi prediksi kripto yang menawarkan hadiah besar. Ia sadar ini lebih mirip judi daripada investasi karena hasilnya murni keberuntungan dan rumah selalu punya keunggulan."}$json$::jsonb where id = 'cd40e584-3c14-42a5-8639-2df128cc33f2';

